meta {
  name: Invite Member
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/me/users
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "buyer@example.com",
    "role": "COMPANY_ADMIN"
  }
}

docs {
**Access:** B2B company admin (bearer; 403 if not COMPANY_ADMIN)

**Request body** `CompanyMemberInvite`:
  - `email`: string (required)
  - `role`: string (required) — one of ['COMPANY_ADMIN', 'BUYER', 'APPROVER', 'VIEWER']

**Responses:** 201, 422
}
